            ('p', 'Take independent legal advice. Many lenders require it, and a solicitor can explain exactly what the document commits you to. Talk to your family if shared assets could be affected. Some insurers offer personal guarantee insurance, which can cover part of the liability if a guarantee is called, and it may be worth asking about.'),
